            "detailed_description": "Have a big journey in a small place filled with magic, monsters, and mystery in TIM-TIM 2: &quot;THE ALMIGHTY GNOME&quot;, a sidescrolling adventure game about a magic wielding gnome. Questing for love and armed with magical scrolls, you will explore dungeons and find that which was taken.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/570110/extras/e4300b031a6055f43a9f377ac1084d31.avif?t=1731007222\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    A big world for a little gnome with over 100 maps to explore.<br></li><li>    Plenty of treasure to find and secrets around every corner.<br></li><li>    Bosses, dungeons, multiple different spells, and townsfolk to interact with.<br></li><li>    An amazing sound track, handcrafted for you to enjoy on your gnomish journey.<br></li><li>    Square Shaped Mushrooms!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/570110/extras/6d4b86625d5becb1194e8fc4604a902d.avif?t=1731007222\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br>Soundtrack by:Meredosia<br>Game made in the OHRRPGCE (o.h.r.rpg.c.e.)",
